/target
# .greyward/ is half record, half cache. The records `ward audit` and a
# sync's join read are committed; everything else in there is
# machine-local. The `**/` matters: a monorepo has a .greyward/ per
# subproject, and so does tests/fixtures/*.
# README.md has the table.
**/.greyward/*
!**/.greyward/closures/
!**/.greyward/resolution/
!**/.greyward/policy.toml
.venv
__pycache__/
